  "body": "Windows prompts for confirmation when a previously untrusted certificate is added to CurrentUser\\Root, leaving release signing stuck on an unattended runner. Install the pinned public home certificate into the disposable hosted runner's LocalMachine stores instead; the private key remains ephemeral. Add progress output and a three-minute signing timeout.\n\nValidation: PowerShell parser and git diff checks passed. The CI release run verifies every signature before packaging. Affected contracts: desktop-distribution.md and development-lifecycle.md; stable still ships the exact CI bundle with all three signatures verified, and development previews remain independent of release packaging.\n\nTracks SHOWS-3.\n",
